Note = {07th Asia-Pacific International Conference on Quality of Life (AQoL),
   Bali, INDONESIA, SEP 30-OCT 02, 2023},
Abstract = {The implementation of warehouse automation has proven to be an effective
   way to increase productivity and inventory accuracy, lower labor costs,
   and improve safety in the warehouse environment. This research aims to
   investigate the factors contributing to the success of warehouse
   automation implementation. This study offers a unique and modern
   warehouse automation environment model as a solution for complete
   implementation in warehouse automation operations. The study was
   conducted in Mali, West Africa. A total of 100 responses were collected
   among warehouse managers through an online Microsoft Forms survey. Smart
   PLS version 4.0 software was used to analyze the data.},
