Year = {2023},
Pages = {15-19},
Note = {2nd International Conference on Mechanical Engineering and Power
   Engineering (MEPE), Wuhan, PEOPLES R CHINA, DEC 29-31, 2023},
Abstract = {With the development of information technology and the Internet of
   Things technology, intelligent sorting equipment has become an
   indispensable part of the modern warehousing and logistics industry. The
   application of intelligent sorting equipment has greatly improved the
   efficiency and accuracy of warehousing logistics, saved a lot of
   manpower and time costs for enterprises, and improved user satisfaction.
   Intelligent sorting equipment plays an important role in modern
   warehousing and logistics, as it can improve warehousing efficiency,
   reduce labor costs, reduce error rates, and improve sorting accuracy and
   speed. By utilizing advanced technologies such as machine vision, LiDAR,
   sensors, and automatic navigation systems, intelligent sorting equipment
   can quickly and accurately identify goods and achieve automated sorting
   and handling. In addition, intelligent sorting equipment can also
   achieve intelligent storage and pickup of goods, making warehousing and
   logistics more intelligent, efficient, and convenient. This article will
   provide a detailed introduction to the application of intelligent
   sorting equipment in warehousing and logistics.},
