Year = {2022},
Note = {12th IEEE International Scientific Technical Conference on Dependable
   Systems, Services and Technologies (DESSERT) - Dependable and
   Trustworthy AI, IoE, Big Data Analytics for a Safe and Secure World,
   Athens, GREECE, DEC 09-11, 2022},
Abstract = {This article describes methodology of acceptance and shipping zones
   calculation during warehouse design procedure. This study demonstrates
   complexity of searching for optimal design solution because of big
   number of input parameters and constraints, that brings thousands of
   combinations to check. Developed system using prediction model and
   serverless computing of different parameter combinations enable decrease
   time for optimal result search and makes warehouse design more
   automated. Results showed in article demonstrates comparison of
   different approaches for the most complex computing part of different
   system parameters combination evaluation using monolith architecture,
   microservices with horizontal auto-scaling and serverless light-weighted
   functional processing. Further research will demonstrate results of
   picking and replenishment (forward-reserve problem-solving) zones
   evaluation and results of scaling serverless computing higher than 1000
   executors at once.},
