   verification line is the core of ShanXi metering center verification
   system, its responsible for verifying about 3 million electric energy
   measuring instruments per year which supported the rapid development of
   ShanXi's smart grid. The paper build a task assignment model of flexible
   job shop scheduling, create a key fact: ``four-line collaborative
   running time{''}, and use the global element and local search element of
   genetic algorithm to get the optimal task assignment scheme, ensured the
   efficiency of the whole verification line, made the allocation of work
   tasks in scheduling process reasonable and efficient, made the
