   Patel, Anubhav D., Indian Inst Informat Technol, Dept Comp Sci \& Engn, Kalyani, W Bengal, India.
   Chowdhury, Abhra R., Indian Inst Sci, Ctr Prod Dev \& Mfg, Div Mech Sci, Bangalore, Karnataka, India.},
DOI = {10.23919/iccas50221.2020.9268394},
ISSN = {2093-7121},
