Abstract = {Trend of requirements continual increase related to the level of
   warehouse performances, as well as achieved technology level, have led
   to use increase of automated solutions in this field of logistic
   systems. At this moment, in the warehouses, great set of different
   automated technologies/solutions has been implemented, from automation
   of certain operations/processes to complete automated processes. Order
   picking, as specially complex, demanding and significant warehouse
   process, presents particularly and interesting field related to
   automation due to direct influence on warehouse performances, and
   therefore supply chain performances. Therefore, this paper aims to,give
   preview of present trends in this field, where the primary is limited to
