   stacker, pallet conveyor and other combination of three-dimensional
   warehouse system are the hot spots of the markets. The three-dimensional
   warehouse in today's logistics industry is quite leading and has a lot
   of clear advantages across the times. The three-dimensional warehouse
   model built by the ROBO Interface and ROBO Pro software is made up of
   the high level three-dimensional shelves, rail stacker and pallet
   transport machine. It can accurately locate, transport and store the
   goods. The use of the new three-dimensional warehouses can make modern
   warehouse storage operation to achieve fully automated precision and
   fast operation. The model can improve the efficient operation of the
   warehouse, make full use of the effective area of the warehouse, and
