   attention given to the existing criteria of their evaluation. A new
   approach to auto-id system evaluation is proposed. It consists in taking
   into account the interaction of the automatic identification subsystem
   with logistics system functional components. Also system energy
   consumption is taken account in accordance with {[}2] since this paper
