Abstract = {This paper provides a description of under floor storage plant for the
   production of edible oil because of its complexity has almost all forms
   of transport material Also one of the reasons is the way of management
   of these transporters and storehouse work organization which was
   processed by computers. Transportation systems which are used in under
   floor stock were analyzed. These transportation systems are chain
   conveyors, belt conveyors, bucket conveyors (elevators), screw conveyors
   and pneumatic conveyors. For the evacuation of dust the aspiration
   conduits were used, thy bag filters and radial ventilators. To avoid
   over complexion of this study, only a partial automation of product
   transport system in the warehouse was explained.},
